        "system": {
          "description": {
            "value": "",
            "instructions": "",
            "unidentified": "<p>The regulation dress worn by cadets of the prestigious Balamb Garden military academy. This distinguished uniform consists of a structured navy blue jacket adorned with golden yellow accents and intricate silver embroidery along the collar and shoulder panels. The formal military styling features a high collar, fitted silhouette, and ceremonial chain detailing that connects across the shoulders - a symbol of the Garden's disciplined traditions.</p><p></p><p>Note: While the uniform code exists, enforcement remains relaxed outside of official events - a testament to the Garden's philosophy that true discipline comes from within rather than external compulsion. Some rebellious students, like a certain gunblade-wielding troublemaker, have been known to completely disregard uniform protocols without facing serious consequences.</p>"
          },
